  "details": "Currently, the only option for URL whitelists are: VRC's default whitelist, or *all URLs*, via \"Allow Untrusted URLs\".\n\nThis feature request is for:\n\n**Allow users to manage their own whitelist and blacklist for URLs**\n\nThis would let users specifically allow URLs in their own whitelist, and block specific ones in a blacklist (even if Untrusted is turned on). It could expand the whitelist options into an enum, allowing at minimum:\n\n- VRC Only\n\n- Custom Whitelist, exclude blacklist\n\n- Allow Untrusted URLs, exclude blacklist\n\n- Allow All Untrusted URLs",
